  "description": "For sheltered Evie, the small world of her church community is all she’s ever known. When her family and community mysteriously disappear, she must venture into Pandora City—a place where supernatural beings walk the streets—to find answers. Instead, she finds the DEVILS, an elite paranormal investigation squad. Paired with Jack, a fierce outcast with a grim past, the two become unlikely partners... and more? As their bond deepens, Evie must navigate a new world of romance, magic… and monsters.\nSource: Tapas",
